{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54755","headline":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金星出，出在卯中央。\n东面兵强莫（京本作「休」）与战，西出西方不可当（京本作「出西面酉酉难当」），勿与动锋枪（辛本、川本作「鬬刀枪」，京本作「勿与鬬锋芒」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54755.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54755","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}